{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/founder-story/layout,_N_T_/about/founder-story/page,_N_T_/about/founder-story"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/about/founder-story/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"display_2a073e65-module__7MkqkG__variable jakarta_55fc869e-module__LB2P7q__variable mono_8ba1b3ff-module__cxzmQq__variable\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/bricolage_grotesque_latin_400_normal-s.p.2_o2v7tpo0q5m.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/bricolage_grotesque_latin_500_normal-s.p.3vqzgd2jdiw22.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/bricolage_grotesque_latin_600_normal-s.p.3_r60-qkmao3a.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/bricolage_grotesque_latin_700_normal-s.p.0rb33xx2bxpl8.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/jetbrains_mono_latin_400_normal-s.p.3crsbyy6lh6yf.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/jetbrains_mono_latin_500_normal-s.p.2h52d08o60qht.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/jetbrains_mono_latin_600_normal-s.p.2mm922pe315l1.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_400_normal-s.p.2ysn9gc82zk1v.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_500_normal-s.p.1evhelic1rxge.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_600_normal-s.p.0p6sew1q6gl7s.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/plus_jakarta_sans_latin_700_normal-s.p.1dulefe5e4s81.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/logo.webp\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/02mkr0z8o939x.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1b-l3oagpuv39.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/11jq0c2_zavac.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4561u0v7ysn3r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/021sppg0zbt0v.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2pcc6e_qu_s3g.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ht-3v40sanoo.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/41mnvtr75by45.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1_p0c8_mtfqqv.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>Founder Story · Why I built Pyngyn | Vivek Pandey</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"The problem I lived. The insight I couldn&#x27;t unsee. The conviction that drove me to build. Vivek Pandey, Founder &amp; CEO of Pyngyn, on why he built the operating system for professional services firms.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Nikunj Chugh\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"Nikunj Chugh\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story/\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Founder Story · Why I built Pyngyn\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Six years inside Wrike, ClickUp and Meta watching PS firms fail to consolidate. Why Vivek Pandey built Pyngyn.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story\",\"name\":\"Founder Story · Why I built Pyngyn\",\"description\":\"Vivek Pandey on why he built Pyngyn, the operating system for professional services firms.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"About\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Founder Story\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/about/founder-story\"}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-transparent\"><div class=\"wrap flex h-[68px] items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><div class=\"hidden h-full lg:flex lg:items-center\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] text-[#3a3a42]\"><a class=\"py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Clientspace</a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Product<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-[30px] pt-[150px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Founder story</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[900px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Why I built <span class=\"text-accent\">Pyngyn.</span></h1><p class=\"lead mt-5 max-w-[720px]\">The problem I lived. The insight I couldn&#x27;t unsee. The conviction that drove me to build.</p><div class=\"mt-5 text-[14px] text-muted\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Vivek Pandey</span> · Founder &amp; CEO, Pyngyn ·<!-- --> <a class=\"text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"mailto:vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com\">vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com</a></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-white p-8 shadow-card md:p-12\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The problem I lived</span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3.4vw,38px)] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]\">I didn&#x27;t find this problem.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-accent\">I sold around it for 6 years.</span></p><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[680px] text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">From the inside of Wrike and ClickUp, I watched PS firms fail to consolidate, over and over again.</p></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The path here</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Six years of context.</h2><ol class=\"mt-7 space-y-4\"><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-accent-lt px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-dk\">2019–2021</span><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink\">Professional Services Consultant</span><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->Wrike</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Implemented SaaS PM tools for enterprise PS clients. Watched knowledge fragment in real time.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-accent-lt px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-dk\">2021–2022</span><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink\">Global Project Manager</span><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->Meta (via Principle)</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Managed cross-functional global initiatives. Felt the cost of misalignment at scale.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-accent-lt px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-dk\">2021–2023</span><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink\">Sr PM &amp; Solutions Architect</span><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->Wrike → ClickUp</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Built ClickUp&#x27;s Template Center. Created knowledge-sharing systems. Saw every workaround fail.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"rounded-full bg-accent-lt px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-dk\">2025</span><span class=\"font-display text-[18px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink\">Founder &amp; CEO</span><span class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">· <!-- -->Pyngyn</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Built the platform I wished existed while working at every one of the above.</p></li></ol></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">What I saw, repeatedly</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[760px] font-display text-[26px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.01em]\">I spent years helping PS firms implement tools that didn&#x27;t solve their real problem.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">35%</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\">Of the day lost to tool-switching</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">I watched this happen at every client I served at Wrike.</div></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">5+</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\">Platforms per engagement</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">At ClickUp I built templates to paper over this, it wasn&#x27;t enough.</div></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">95%</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\">Team misalignment</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Cross-functional projects at Meta showed me misalignment at scale.</div></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"font-display text-[34px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\">0</div><div class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\">SOPs that surface when needed</div><div class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">No tool I implemented ever solved the SOP activation problem.</div></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The insight</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">The problem was never productivity.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-accent\">It was always fragmentation.</span></h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\">I saw it from the inside</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">At Wrike and ClickUp I watched firms add tools to fix coordination. Every tool made it worse. Knowledge scattered further. Consultants drowned in context-switching.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\">AI alone doesn&#x27;t fix it</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Generic AI doesn&#x27;t know your firm. It can&#x27;t surface the right SOP at the right moment in the right workflow. I knew the answer had to be contextual, not generic.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\">The OS layer didn&#x27;t exist</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Every tool I implemented was a point solution. Nobody had unified knowledge, tasks, SOPs, and AI into one operating layer built specifically for PS firms. So I built it.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The conviction</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Why I&#x27;m the one to build this.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[22px] md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-bold\">I built the tools I&#x27;m now replacing</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">2+ years at Wrike implementing SaaS PM tools for PS firms. 1+ year at ClickUp building their knowledge-sharing infrastructure. I understand this category from the inside out.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-bold\">I know exactly why existing tools fail</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">I didn&#x27;t just use these platforms, I sold them, implemented them, and watched them fall short. I know the gap between what firms need and what every incumbent delivers.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-bold\">I&#x27;m building a compounding moat</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Every SOP built, every engagement logged, every task completed makes Pyngyn smarter for that firm. The platform compounds in value over time, that&#x27;s why churn goes near zero after 6 months.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-7 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-[#fbfbfd] p-6\"><div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">My unfair advantage</div><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\">6 yrs inside Wrike, ClickUp &amp; Meta</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\">Implemented PS tools at 100+ firms</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\">MBA, MIS &amp; Project Management</li><li class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\">Knows every competitor from the inside</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The retention moat</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">Pyngyn gets smarter the more you use it.</h2><ol class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-mono text-[14px] font-bold\">1</span><div class=\"text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Firm adds knowledge, SOPs &amp; engagements</div></div></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-mono text-[14px] font-bold\">2</span><div class=\"text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">AI learns the firm&#x27;s context &amp; patterns</div></div></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-mono text-[14px] font-bold\">3</span><div class=\"text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Tasks surface the right SOP at the right time</div></div></li><li class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-5 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent text-white font-mono text-[14px] font-bold\">4</span><div class=\"text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Outcomes improve, more data added</div></div></li></ol><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[760px] text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><strong class=\"text-ink\">Result:</strong> near-zero churn after 6 months, Pyngyn becomes the firm&#x27;s institutional memory.</p></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Why now</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">The tailwinds have never been stronger.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 space-y-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">AI adoption is accelerating in PS, but it&#x27;s generic</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">78% of consultants now use AI tools. But they&#x27;re using tools that don&#x27;t know their firm. I left ClickUp knowing the contextual AI layer for PS didn&#x27;t exist. The window to build it is now.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">Firms are under margin pressure post-pandemic</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">PS firms are being asked to do more with leaner teams. Fragmentation is no longer just annoying, it&#x27;s a P&amp;L problem. Every hour lost to tool-switching is a billable hour that never happened.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">Remote work permanently broke knowledge transfer</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">The informal hallway knowledge transfer is gone forever. Firms are haemorrhaging institutional knowledge and every tool they try just adds another silo. The timing for a unified OS is perfect.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"wrap py-[40px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[24px] border border-line bg-[#0b0d12] p-8 text-white shadow-art md:p-12\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dark\">In closing</span><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3.4vw,38px)] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]\">I spent 6 years inside the tools that failed PS firms.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-accent\">Now I&#x27;m building the one that doesn&#x27;t.</span></p><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[680px] text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/70\">We&#x27;re building the intelligence layer PS firms will run on. Seeking strategic partners who understand that the future of work is smarter integration.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5\"><a class=\"btn bg-white text-ink hover:bg-white/90\" href=\"/demo/\">Book a 20-minute conversation →</a><a class=\"btn border border-white/15 bg-white/5 text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/solutions/professional-services/\">See the platform</a></div><div class=\"mt-6 text-[13px] text-white/55\"><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"mailto:vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com\">vivek.pandey@pyngyn.com</a> <!-- -->· pyngyn.ai</div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p c