s-functional projects at Meta showed me misalignment at scale.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"SOPs that surface when needed\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-[34px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-accent\",\"children\":\"0\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-ink\",\"children\":\"SOPs that surface when needed\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1.5 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"No tool I implemented ever solved the SOP activation problem.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap py-[40px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"The insight\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,36px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\",\"children\":[\"The problem was never productivity.\",\" \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-accent\",\"children\":\"It was always fragmentation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"01\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-num\",\"children\":\"01\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"I saw it from the inside\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"At Wrike and ClickUp I watched firms add tools to fix coordination. Every tool made it worse. Knowledge scattered further. Consultants drowned in context-switching.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"02\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-num\",\"children\":\"02\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"AI alone doesn't fix it\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Generic AI doesn't know your firm. It can't surface the right SOP at the right moment in the right workflow. I knew the answer had to be contextual, not generic.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"03\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"index-num\",\"children\":\"03\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"The OS layer didn't exist\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Every tool I implemented was a point solution. Nobody had unified knowledge, tasks, SOPs, and AI into one operating layer built specifically for PS firms. So I built it.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap py-[40px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"The conviction\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 font-display text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\",\"children\":\"Why I'm the one to build this.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-7 grid gap-[22px] md:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"I built the tools I'm now replacing\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"I built the tools I'm now replacing\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"2+ years at Wrike implementing SaaS PM tools for PS firms. 1+ year at ClickUp building their knowledge-sharing infrastructure. I understand this category from the inside out.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"I know exactly why existing tools fail\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"I know exactly why existing tools fail\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"I didn't just use these platforms, I sold them, implemented them, and watched them fall short. I know the gap between what firms need and what every incumbent delivers.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"I'm building a compounding moat\",{\"className\":\"card h-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-bold\",\"children\":\"I'm building a compounding moat\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Every SOP built, every engagement logged, every task completed makes Pyngyn smarter for that firm. The platform compounds in value over time, that's why churn goes near zero after 6 months.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-7 rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-[#fbfbfd] p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\",\"children\":\"My unfair advantage\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"6 yrs inside Wrike, ClickUp & Meta\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\",\"children\":\"6 yrs inside Wrike, ClickUp & Meta\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Implemented PS tools at 100+ firms\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\",\"children\":\"Implemented PS tools at 100+ firms\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"MBA, MIS & Project Management\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\",\"children\":\"MBA, MIS & Project Management\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Knows every competitor from the inside\",{\"className\":\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\",\"children\":\"Knows every competitor from the inside\"}]]}]]}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap py-[40px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"